      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "个解：",
        "а) $3x+2y=1$；　　б) $xy=12$；",
        "в) $5y-2x=7$；　　г) $xy=-8$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "417",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "任意作一个二元方程，使它的解是下列数对：",
        "а) $x=2$，$y=4.5$，　　б) $x=-1$，$y=2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "418",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下列含变量 $p$ 和 $q$ 的方程有没有解？",
        "а) $p^2+q^2=-4$；　　б) $2p-q+2=2p-q+7$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "419",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下列方程有几个解？",
        "а) $x^2+y^2=0$；　　б) $(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "420",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "数对 $(u,v)$ 中，$u$ 的值可以任意取，$v$ 的值等于 5。证明",
        "数对是方程 $0u+7v=35$ 的解。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "421",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求下列方程的任意三个解：",
        "а) $0x+2y=6$；　　б) $4x+0y=-12$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "422",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程 $x+2y=18$ 的解当中，有一个数对是由相同的两个",
        "数组成的。求出这个数对。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "423",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用列数对的方法写出集合：",
        "а) $\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in N,y\\in N,x+y=5\\}$；",
        "б) $\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in N,y\\in N,2x+y=22\\}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "424",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "每付跳棋值 3 卢布，每付象棋值 5 卢布，农村俱乐部买",
        "了 $p$ 付跳棋和 $q$ 付象棋，付款 67 卢布。买了多少付象",
        "棋？（求出所有的解。）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "425",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一本练习本值 2 戈比，一支铅笔值 3 戈比。一个学生买",
        "了 $n$ 本练习本和 $m$ 支铅笔，付款 19 戈比。这个学生买",
        "了几支铅笔？（求出所有的解。）"
      ]
    },
